Z||000000||Wolfhound||09-25-2001||07:48 AM||||most of these were taken from inside the car and I hope they give a sense of the experience.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/f01.JPG"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/f02.JPG"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/f03_1.JPG"> <BR>The Gold Se in the foreground was the car i brought. 208,000 miles on the clock.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/f04.JPG"> <BR>||||reg||1
