Z||000004||Dragon||09-25-2001||09:39 AM||||Some of us did happen to go faster than posted.  That is why the Park Ranger chewed Freddie Clark out.  It just depended where you were at in the pack.  Especially on the second part of the run.  Damn had a blast.<P>Did anyone go to the Deals Gap - The Dragon<P><P>------------------<BR>Dragon<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://spacecoastfieros.com/dragon.jpg">   <P>   Space Coast Fieros||||reg||1
Z||000005||Songman||09-25-2001||10:32 AM||||I ran the Dragon with them. It was a blast! Only one mishap when the 4th car in front of me did a 180 on a curve and ended up facing back toward us, but she got it turned around and we were off again. We still had 10 cars on that day... ||||reg||1
